      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How devices connect\n\nThe official architecture page names four device types (hub-connected, direct-connected, cloud-connected, mobile-connected). Direct-connected splits\ninto two very different protocols, so this guide treats it as two paths. All five converge on the same device record.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How devices connect\n\nThe official architecture page names four device types (hub-connected, direct-connected, cloud-connected, mobile-connected). Direct-connected splits into two very different protocols, so this guide treats it as two paths. All five converge on the same device record.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
